      <div class="loc-map rv rv-d1">
        <iframe src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=18%20Jalan%20Perdana%206%2F8b%2C%20Pandan%20Perdana%2C%2055300%20Kuala%20Lumpur&z=16&output=embed" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; border:0; filter:grayscale(0.1);" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" title="Dateen HQ, Pandan Perdana, Kuala Lumpur"></iframe>
        <span class="loc-cover">Serving KL + Selangor</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 11 FAQ ============ -->
<section class="sec" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="idx">11</span>
      <span class="label">Frequently Asked</span>
      <span class="meta">Before you place an order</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <div class="faq-list rv">
        <details class="faq-it" open>
          <summary>
            <span class="n">01</span>
            <h5>What areas do you serve?</h5>
            <span class="tg"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="ans">We deliver across Kuala Lumpur and Selangor, including Petaling Jaya, Subang, Shah Alam, Cheras, Ampang, KLCC, Bangsar and Mont Kiara. Free delivery applies to orders above RM50 within the Klang Valley.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-it">
          <summary>
            <span class="n">02</span>
            <h5>What types of catering do you offer?</h5>
            <span class="tg"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="ans">Buffet catering, bento meals, daily bungkus supply, vegetarian lines and cold brew, serving corporate functions, training sessions, festive open houses and private events.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-it">
          <summary>
            <span class="n">03</span>
            <h5>What is the minimum order?</h5>
            <span class="tg"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="ans">À la carte bento and daily sets start from a single box, with no minimum. Served buffet catering is available from 35 pax, orders below 35 pax carry a 20% surcharge. Drop-off (delivery-only) catering has no minimum order.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-it">
          <summary>
            <span class="n">04</span>
            <h5>Can I customise my menu?</h5>
            <span class="tg"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="ans">Yes. Menus are mixed and matched to your headcount, budget and dietary requirements, including vegetarian and allergen-conscious options. Share your brief via WhatsApp and we'll propose a tailored menu.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-it">
          <summary>
            <span class="n">05</span>
            <h5>How early should I book?</h5>
            <span class="tg"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="ans">Daily bungkus and bento orders confirmed before 10:00am qualify for same-day delivery. Buffet and event catering should be confirmed at least 3 working days ahead; festive-season dates book out earlier.</div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


